OL,3,GNEWSASalford Royal surgery unit fails
OL,4,Ato improve rating
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurgery services at a Greater
OL,7,FManchester hospital have been rated as
OL,8,Frequiring improvement after an
OL,9,Finspection found further work was
OL,10,Fneeded to ensure patients received safe
OL,11,Fand timely care.
OL,13,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) found
OL,14,FSalford Royal Hospital had made enough
OL,15,Fprogress to comply with a warning
OL,16,Fnotice issued in October 2025 over
OL,17,Fstaffing levels and risk management,
OL,18,Fbut identified 12 breaches of
OL,19,Fregulations relating to patient safety,
OL,20,Fgovernance and staffing.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
