OL,3,GNEWSASalford Royal surgery unit fails
OL,4,Ato improve rating
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inspection was carried out in May
OL,7,Ffollowing concerns about staffing,
OL,8,Fgovernance and safety processes in
OL,9,Fgynaecology, spinal surgery and
OL,10,Fneurosurgery.
OL,12,FKaren Coverley, deputy chief nursing
OL,13,Fofficer, said the trust was pleased
OL,14,Finspectors had recognised improvements
